---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteSettings, whatsappLink } from "../data/siteSettings";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Policies"
  description="Rugofs Foods delivery, refund, privacy, and terms of service policies."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Ordering With Confidence</p>
        <h1>Policies</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="open-note">
        These policies reflect how Rugofs Foods currently operates. As our
        business grows — delivery partners, order tracking, and more — these
        policies will be updated to match. If you have any questions, reach
        out to us any time.
      </div>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <h2 id="delivery">Delivery Policy</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>In-store pickup</strong> has no delivery fee. Message us on
        WhatsApp to confirm pickup details for your order.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Delivery</strong> is currently arranged directly with our
        team rather than calculated automatically at checkout — our online
        payment system doesn't yet include a live delivery-fee calculator
        or courier integration. After you order, message us on WhatsApp
        with your delivery address and we'll confirm the delivery fee and
        expected timing for your location within Port Harcourt before
        anything is dispatched. We are not certain of exact delivery
        timeframes outside Port Harcourt at this time — please ask us
        directly if you're ordering from further away.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not yet have order tracking. Once your order is confirmed and
        paid for, we'll coordinate delivery or pickup with you by phone or
        WhatsApp.
      </p>

      <h2 id="refunds">Refund &amp; Returns Policy</h2>
      <p>
        Because Rugofs products are food items, we're unable to accept
        returns of any pack that has already been opened.
      </p>
      <p>
        If your order arrives <strong>damaged, incorrect, or defective</strong>,
        please contact us on WhatsApp within 48 hours of receiving it, with
        a photo of the product and your order/payment reference. We'll work
        with you on a replacement or refund once we've verified the issue.
      </p>
      <p>
        If a payment is taken in error or a transaction fails after your
        card or bank account was charged, message us with your payment
        reference and we'll help resolve it directly with Paystack, our
        payment processor.
      </p>
      <h2 id="privacy">Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        When you place an order or send us a message, we collect the
        information you provide — name, email address, phone number, and
        (for orders) delivery details — solely to process your order or
        respond to your enquiry. We do not sell or share your information
        with third parties for marketing purposes.
      </p>
      <p>
        Card and bank payment details are handled directly by{" "}
        <a href="https://paystack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Paystack
        </a>
        , our payment processor — Rugofs Foods does not see or store your
        full card number or bank credentials. Paystack's own privacy and
        security practices govern how that payment data is handled; we
        recommend reviewing Paystack's policies directly if you'd like more
        detail before paying.
      </p>
      <p>
        Contact form submissions are processed via Netlify Forms. We use
        the details you submit only to reply to you.
      </p>

      <h2 id="terms">Terms of Service</h2>
      <p>
        By placing an order or using this website, you agree to the
        policies on this page. Product availability, pack sizes, and prices
        shown are current as of your visit but may change without notice.
      </p>
      <p>
        All products sold are NAFDAC-registered where stated on the product
        page. Rugofs Foods is a Nigerian business based in Port Harcourt,
        Rivers State, and these terms are intended to be read under
        Nigerian law.
      </p>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <p class="policy-contact">
        Questions about any of these policies? Message us on{" "}
        <a
          href={whatsappLink("Hi Rugofs Foods, I have a question about your policies.")}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          WhatsApp
        </a>{" "}
        or email{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${siteSettings.email}`}>{siteSettings.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .policy-contact {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
